  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 610.07 Procedures for Establishing a General State Permit. If the department grants the petition, the department shall proceed in accordance with Env-A 620 to establish a general state permit for the approved source category.\n\nSource. #6782-B, eff 6-30-98; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
